        desc = "LSADC_CTRL22 is the average algorithm data register for LSADC channel 2. (offset 0x58; total reset 0x00000000; PROVEN: Hi3516E V300 data sheet (Issue 00B06, 2019-05-15), section 12.7.5, PDF page 796). INFERRED: some fields could not be extracted cleanly, see the TODO file.";
        field {
